WEBVTT

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:06.302
It's quite rare for maps and satellite
images to have these blank spots

00:05:06.344 --> 00:05:09.430
because blank areas tend
to draw attention to themselves.

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:10.723
But here we got lucky.

00:05:11.265 --> 00:05:16.270
Obscuring the camps had inadvertently
revealed all of their locations.

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:17.521
(Laughter)

00:05:17.563 --> 00:05:23.611
(Applause)

00:05:24.612 --> 00:05:26.739
We worked with developer Christo Buschek,

00:05:26.781 --> 00:05:29.992
who specializes in documenting
human rights issues

00:05:29.992 --> 00:05:32.453
and building tools
for open-source researchers